# Used by `pnpm build`. Vite compiles this value into the bundle, so rebuild and
# redeploy after changing it. Nothing here is secret: everything a VITE_-prefixed
# variable holds ships to the browser.
#
# Relative on purpose: the app calls /v1 on whatever host it was opened on, so
# howtobac.ro and www.howtobac.ro both work and CORS never applies. This needs
# the reverse proxy to forward /v1 to http://192.168.3.109:7500.
#
# Don't put a LAN address here (e.g. http://192.168.3.109:7500): an HTTPS page
# can't call an HTTP address, and visitors can't reach your private network.
VITE_API_URL=/v1
